Version 4
SymbolType BLOCK
RECTANGLE Normal -48 -32 48 32
WINDOW 0 0 -32 Bottom 2
WINDOW 3 0 32 Top 2
SYMATTR Prefix X
SYMATTR InstName X1
SYMATTR SpiceModel MPC
SYMATTR ModelFile MPC.sub
SYMATTR Description Generic MPC model of a two-winding common-mode choke. Windings are port1-port2 and port3-port4.
PIN -48 -16 LEFT 8
PINATTR PinName port1
PINATTR SpiceOrder 1
PIN 48 -16 RIGHT 8
PINATTR PinName port2
PINATTR SpiceOrder 2
PIN -48 16 LEFT 8
PINATTR PinName port3
PINATTR SpiceOrder 3
PIN 48 16 RIGHT 8
PINATTR PinName port4
PINATTR SpiceOrder 4
